        "content": "June 2020 shifted from May’s broad community involvement to focused, solitary embedded work. All 10 commits landed in MRNIU/FreeRTOS-PortentaH7, with a short early detour into Simple-XX/OSPP. The main effort bootstrapped a FreeRTOS port for the Portenta H7: setting up the Makefile build, adding startup code, and updating library versions, though the port remained theoretical and untested. Unlike May’s 6 active repos, PRs, and issue discussions, this month had zero collaboration—no reviews, issues, or comments. The steady weekly cadence shows a disciplined push from coordination into hands-on, low-level firmware bringup.",
